  "_comment": "🔮️ This subset's own contribution to the repository test platform: `ruststep` 0.4 registered as the real ISO 10303-21 reader for stdio.step ap214/✳️base's exhaustive StepMutation vocabulary, the mutation catalog it is measured against, and the tolerant structural comparison profile a re-serialized STEP exchange structure needs against an independently parsed one.",
  "oracles": [
    {
      "id": "ruststep-step-ap214-base-mutate",
      "ecosystem": "rust",
